{"slug":"b-l-gh","ar":"ب ل غ","total":77,"core":"reaching; conveying","forms":[{"ar":"بَلَغَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":40,"gloss":"to reach","word":null,"ex":{"s":56,"a":83,"p":3,"ar":["فَلَوْلَآ","إِذَا","بَلَغَتِ","ٱلْحُلْقُومَ"],"en":"Then why, when the soul at death reaches the throat"}},{"ar":"بَلَٰغ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":15,"gloss":"conveyance, message","word":null,"ex":{"s":36,"a":17,"p":4,"ar":["وَمَا","عَلَيْنَآ","إِلَّا","ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ","ٱلْمُبِينُ"],"en":"And we are not responsible except for clear notification"}},{"ar":"بَٰلِغ","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":6,"gloss":"reaching, attaining","word":null,"ex":{"s":7,"a":135,"p":8,"ar":["فَلَمَّا","كَشَفْنَا","عَنْهُمُ","ٱلرِّجْزَ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَجَلٍ","هُم","بَـٰلِغُوهُ","إِذَا","هُمْ","يَنكُثُونَ"],"en":"But when We removed the punishment from them until a term which they were to reach, then at once they broke their word"}},{"ar":"بَلَّغْ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":6,"gloss":"to convey","word":null,"ex":{"s":7,"a":68,"p":1,"ar":["أُبَلِّغُكُمْ","رِسَـٰلَـٰتِ","رَبِّى","وَأَنَا۠","لَكُمْ","نَاصِحٌ","أَمِينٌ"],"en":"I convey to you the messages of my Lord, and I am to you a trustworthy adviser"}},{"ar":"أَبْلَغُ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":5,"gloss":"to convey; to escort","word":null,"ex":{"s":72,"a":28,"p":4,"ar":["لِّيَعْلَمَ","أَن","قَدْ","أَبْلَغُوا۟","رِسَـٰلَـٰتِ","رَبِّهِمْ","وَأَحَاطَ","بِمَا","لَدَيْهِمْ","وَأَحْصَىٰ","كُلَّ","شَىْءٍ","عَدَدًۢا"],"en":"That he may know that they have conveyed the messages of their Lord; and He has encompassed whatever is with them and has enumerated all things in number"}},{"ar":"بَٰلِغَة","kind":"active participle","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"far-reaching, consummate","word":null,"ex":{"s":54,"a":5,"p":2,"ar":["حِكْمَةٌۢ","بَـٰلِغَةٌ ۖ","فَمَا","تُغْنِ","ٱلنُّذُرُ"],"en":"Extensive wisdom - but warning does not avail [them]"}},{"ar":"بَلِيغ","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"effective, penetrating","word":null,"ex":{"s":4,"a":63,"p":16,"ar":["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَعْلَمُ","ٱللَّهُ","مَا","فِى","قُلُوبِهِمْ","فَأَعْرِضْ","عَنْهُمْ","وَعِظْهُمْ","وَقُل","لَّهُمْ","فِىٓ","أَنفُسِهِمْ","قَوْلًۢا","بَلِيغًا"],"en":"Those are the ones of whom Allah knows what is in their hearts, so turn away from them but admonish them and speak to them a far-reaching word"}},{"ar":"مَبْلَغ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"extent, sum","word":null,"ex":{"s":53,"a":30,"p":2,"ar":["ذَٰلِكَ","مَبْلَغُهُم","مِّنَ","ٱلْعِلْمِ ۚ","إِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","هُوَ","أَعْلَمُ","بِمَن","ضَلَّ","عَن","سَبِيلِهِۦ","وَهُوَ","أَعْلَمُ","بِمَنِ","ٱهْتَدَىٰ"],"en":"That is their sum of knowledge. Indeed, your Lord is most knowing of who strays from His way, and He is most knowing of who is guided"}}],"surahs":[[18,7],[2,5],[5,5],[7,5],[40,5],[6,4],[46,4],[13,3],[16,3],[17,3],[24,3],[3,2],[4,2],[33,2],[65,2],[72,2],[9,1],[11,1],[12,1],[14,1],[19,1],[21,1],[22,1],[28,1],[29,1],[34,1],[36,1],[37,1],[42,1],[48,1],[53,1],[54,1],[56,1],[64,1],[68,1],[75,1]]}